From 3334160221319ff48353de1dcf1e8edf30e24560 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 06:07:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app): the 3+2 under-table refusal names the heights the
 user set

FirstTraverseUnderTable now gives its plane and its limit in the frame
where the user sets the clearance height (local + origin Z, as #2991
does for FirstTraverseLow). The text gives the values in mm along the
tilted tool axis, not as Z values. The refusal decision (#3081) does
not change.

Fixes #3148

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
